<!-- ① 跨经理行为热力图 -->
<h4>① 跨经理行为热力图（6 经理 × 6 维序数，深色=行为越突出）</h4>
<p class="muted" style="margin:2px 0 8px">同一组六维序数（1=低 → 5=极高）铺成网格：横向比经理、纵向比维度，深色格即该经理在该维能力最强（高=优秀，面积越大=能力越强）。<b>读法：</b>巴菲特在"风险应对力·主动收益力·投资纪律性·成本控制力"整列最深（全面最强）；张坤/葛兰在"行业配置力"整列最深（重注单一赛道）；蔡嵩松在"风险应对力·主动收益力·投资纪律性·成本控制力"整列最浅（综合最弱）。</p>
<div class="pv-heat">
  <div class="pv-hrow pv-hhead"><div class="pv-hcell pv-name">经理</div><div class="pv-hcell">行业配置力</div><div class="pv-hcell">风险应对力</div><div class="pv-hcell">主动收益力</div><div class="pv-hcell">投资纪律性</div><div class="pv-hcell">风险转化力</div><div class="pv-hcell">成本控制力</div></div>
  <div class="pv-hrow"><div class="pv-hcell pv-name" style="color:#2e7d8a">张坤</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#7fc4c4">3</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#3a9d9d;color:#fff">4</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#3a9d9d;color:#fff">4</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#7fc4c4">3</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div></div>
  <div class="pv-hrow"><div class="pv-hcell pv-name" style="color:#1f6b3a">朱少醒</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#bfe0e0">2</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#7fc4c4">3</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#3a9d9d;color:#fff">4</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#7fc4c4">3</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div></div>
  <div class="pv-hrow"><div class="pv-hcell pv-name" style="color:#9a3412">葛兰</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#bfe0e0">2</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#7fc4c4">3</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#7fc4c4">3</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#3a9d9d;color:#fff">4</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#bfe0e0">2</div></div>
  <div class="pv-hrow"><div class="pv-hcell pv-name" style="color:#7c3aed">蔡嵩松</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#3a9d9d;color:#fff">4</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#e6f2f2">1</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#bfe0e0">2</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#bfe0e0">2</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#e6f2f2">1</div></div>
  <div class="pv-hrow"><div class="pv-hcell pv-name" style="color:#1f4e79">巴菲特</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#3a9d9d;color:#fff">4</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#7fc4c4">3</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div></div>
  <div class="pv-hrow"><div class="pv-hcell pv-name" style="color:#be123c">林奇</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#bfe0e0">2</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#7fc4c4">3</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#0f6e6e;color:#fff">5</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#7fc4c4">3</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#3a9d9d;color:#fff">4</div><div class="pv-hcell" style="background:#e6f2f2">1</div></div>
</div>
<div class="pv-scale"><span>序数深浅：</span><span class="ramp"><span style="background:#e6f2f2"></span><span style="background:#bfe0e0"></span><span style="background:#7fc4c4"></span><span style="background:#3a9d9d"></span><span style="background:#0f6e6e"></span></span><span>1（浅）→ 5（深）</span></div>

<!-- ② 平行坐标 -->
<h4>② 平行坐标：每位经理是一条"行为形状线"（纵轴=序数 0–5）</h4>
<p class="muted" style="margin:2px 0 4px"><b>读法：</b>每条彩线是一位经理在六个行为轴上的"形状"。线越靠上=该维能力越强（面积越大=综合能力越强）。<b>巴菲特</b>的线在五轴齐冲顶（风控/收益/纪律/成本全面最强）；<b>张坤</b>在行业配置与成本控制两极凸起但中段下凹；<b>蔡嵩松</b>除风险转化力外全线塌底（综合最弱）；<b>林奇</b>在主动收益力冲顶但成本控制力塌底——一眼可分出"能力强弱与短板"。</p>
